## System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have recently discovered a bug in my game:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ea4ae22-4ba9-4200-ba03-4055b8e95043\n\nThe dialogue ends abruptly. Here's no-bug version:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f8895cb-154e-478b-a84d-e9dbf0eff245\n\nI'm incrementing `characters_visible` via code. For whatever reason, RichTextLabel will miss the last word. `characters_visible` does reach it, it just doesn't display.\n\nIt works correctly in 4.5 dev5. Also I accidentally discovered that changing the size of RichTextLabel fixes the bug, so as a workaround I'm randomizing the width within one pixel after every character 💀\n\nUnfortunately I was not able to reproduce it in a minimal project, with the same font, RichtTextLabel size etc.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAnimate `visible_characters` in RichTextLabel and it _may_ happen (??).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCouldn't reproduce in minimal project. It can be reproduced reliably in my game.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"ht